{
"#name"
:
{
"ohmyposh"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"为 oh-my-posh 设计的增强模块"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced modules designed for oh-my-posh"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
null
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"oh-my-posh is a cross platform tool to render your prompt.\nIt can use the same configuration everywhere to offer a consistent experience, regardless of where you are.\nFor a detailed guide on getting started, have a look at the docs at https://ohmyposh.dev\n"
,
"cn"
:
"oh-my-posh 是一个跨平台工具，用于渲染你的提示符。\n它可以在任何地方使用相同的配置，提供一致的体验，无论你在哪里。\n有关入门指南的详细说明，请查看 https://ohmyposh.dev 上的文档。\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"当前模块仅适用于 bash 和 zsh 环境"
,
"en"
:
"This module is currently only compatible with bash and zsh environments."
}
]
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"罗列所有主题"
,
"en"
:
"List all theme"
}
}
,
"fz"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"交互式罗列所有主题的预览效果"
,
"en"
:
"An interactive list showcasing previews of all the themes"
}
}
,
"which"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"获取指定主题的配置文件路径"
,
"en"
:
"Retrieve the configuration file path for the specified theme"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x ohmyposh which [NAME]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#exec:stdout"
:
"___x_cmd ohmyposh --advise-ls"
}
,
"use"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"全局使用指定的主题"
,
"en"
:
"Apply the specified theme globally"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x ohmyposh use [NAME]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#exec:stdout"
:
"___x_cmd ohmyposh --advise-ls"
}
,
"unuse"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"取消全局使用的主题"
,
"en"
:
"Use the specified theme globally"
}
}
,
"try"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"在当前会话尝试使用指定主题"
,
"en"
:
"In this current Shell, attempt to use the specified theme"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x ohmyposh try [NAME]"
:
null
}
]
,
"#exec:stdout"
:
"___x_cmd ohmyposh --advise-ls"
}
,
"untry"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"取消当前会话尝试使用的主题"
,
"en"
:
"Cancel the theme that the current Shell is trying to use"
}
}
,
"raw"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"使用 oh-my-posh 原生命令"
,
"en"
:
"Use the native commands of oh-my-posh"
}
,
"$ref"
:
"x-cmd-advise://oh-my-posh/advise.t.jso"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x ohmyposh use M365Princess"
,
"cn"
:
"全局使用 M365Princess 主题"
,
"en"
:
"Use the M365Princess theme globally"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ohmyposh unuse"
,
"cn"
:
"取消全局使用的主题"
,
"en"
:
"Cancel the theme that is currently used globally"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ohmyposh try half-life"
,
"cn"
:
"在当前会话尝试使用 half-life 主题"
,
"en"
:
"Try to use the half-life theme in this current Shell"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x ohmyposh"
,
"cn"
:
"调用 `x ohmyposh fz` 命令，交互式预览 oh-my-posh 主题"
,
"en"
:
"Invoke the command `x ohmyposh fz` to interactively preview the oh-my-posh theme"
}
]
,
"#subcmd_help_tip"
:
true
,
"#other"
:
{
"en"
:
{
"Please visit our homepage for more information:"
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
,
"cn"
:
{
"请访问我们的主页以获取更多信息："
:
"https://x-cmd.com"
}
}
}

